      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "The Conduit carries bursts anywhere, with no loss.\n- §9Wormhole Mouths§r: right-click one with a Data Stick, then the other: they are paired, at any distance, even in another dimension. A stream enters a ring through its front face (the controller's side) and leaves the partner out of its back. To take a jet, lay a mouth on a quasar cap with its front-face centre on the port cell, facing the quasar.\n- §9Mirrors§r turn a stream 90° (any facing; either throat in).\n- §9Junctions§r split (the big throat in; out 3 takes its fixed % first; out 1 and out 2 share the rest by c + k × (s/15 - 0.5), s from its Burst Control Hatch) or combine (three in, one out).\n- A stream flies straight through up to 64 blocks of air to the next throat or a GRB Receptor Port. The scanner names the target, or where it is blocked.\n\nPut a throat in each controller and fuel in its input hatches. A new element opens after 10 s of paid upkeep. One throat caps the whole element; the excess is clipped, never damage. Keep every element chunk-loaded: an unloaded one breaks the path.\n\n§2§lDONE §lWHEN§r you hold two Wormhole Mouths, a Conduit Mirror and a Conduit Junction (HOLD → CLAIM → INSTALL).",
